OL,3,A'This is sabotage': Hegseth defends
OL,4,AIran war record after Republican
OL,5,Alaunches impeachment attempt
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth is
OL,8,Fholding a news conference at the
OL,9,FPentagon after a Republican congressman
OL,10,Flaunched an attempt to impeach him -
OL,11,Fwatch live via the link above
OL,13,FIn his first news conference in six
OL,14,Fmonths, the defence secretary calls the
OL,15,Fimpeachment effort a "farce" and
OL,16,Fdefends the US's "lawful military
OL,17,Foperations"
OL,19,FHegseth adds: "This is not patriotism.
OL,20,FThis is sabotage"
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
