OL,3,A'This is sabotage': Hegseth defends
OL,4,AIran war record after Republican
OL,5,Alaunches impeachment attempt
OL,6,
OL,7,FArticles of impeachment were introduced
OL,8,Finto the House of Representatives on
OL,9,FMonday by Republican Thomas Massie, who
OL,10,Fsays the defence secretary violated the
OL,11,Fconstitution by not seeking approval
OL,12,Ffor the war
OL,14,FThe effort will likely fail, as
OL,15,FRepublicans remain in power in Congress
OL,16,Funtil January, meaning they have the
OL,17,Fmajority power over any vote
